## Entry points

`Data → Core → Net + UI → ChurchOfBeef.lua` (bootstrap last).

| Phase | Runs |
|-------|------|
| `ADDON_LOADED` (`ChurchOfBeef`) | `COB.DB:Init()` |
| `PLAYER_LOGIN` | bootstrap `initUi()` (per-module Init), `COB.Net:Init()`, `InstallWire()` |
| `/beef` | `COB.PlayerCard:Toggle()` (`/beef console` → `COB.Console:Show()`) |

SV direction: account-level `ChurchOfBeefDB` (no server = per-client persistence, §13.1; store scope is account-wide, §12 / Audit §6.3). BeefNet prefix `COB` / channel `GUILD`.

